	(text "+ Component values depend on the microphone/transducer\n  With a 40kHz Ultrasonic transducer, L1=6.8mH, R1=150R (or 220R)\n  L1 may not be required with other transducers\n* These components are not normally used, but may be needed for stability\n  L2 may be in the range 10uH to 6.8mH depending on the transducer\nRV4B may need a 47K resistor in parallel if there is too much feedback\n  (volume or instability)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.574 27.686 0)
		(effects
